</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s252S">Those <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w3">pleasure beings</span> who are <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s252w2">wrapped in deep meditation</span> at the level we call the &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w1"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m3">realm</span> of <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m2">limitless</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m1">space</span></span>&quot; <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w5">see</span> the water <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w4"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m5">as</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s252m4">empty space</span></span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p5">for</span> their <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w7">ability to conceptualize</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w6">physical matter</span> has <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w9">dissolved</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s252w8">altogether</span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p1"><span class="nul">Closure of the final verb in C05:251, with no separate English word in this row.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p2"><span class="nul">Plurality is fused into beings, with no separate English plural word.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p3"><span class="nul">Agent relation has no separate English word; English subject syntax expresses it.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p4"><span class="nul">Genitive relation is fused into the English conceptualize plus direct-object construction; no separate genitive word.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s252p6"><span class="nul">Assertive closure, with no separate English word.</span></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment reconciled by Codex (gpt-6-astra). Initial go is the wordless closure of C05:251's 'jug, preserved in this row under the registered E-111 boundary-spill class. The technical realm name is a d5 compound with three strict members; its space is the first English occurrence. Snyoms par zhugs pa owns the complete predicative phrase wrapped in deep meditation at d3, excluding who are; the phrasing is not decomposed into invented wrapped or deep atoms. Lha owns pleasure beings; rnams contributes plural morphology fused into beings, and kyis has no separate agent word. The later nam mkhar owns as empty space: the case-conditioned nam mkha stem owns empty space and its bound r owns predicative as. The nominal 'du shes owns ability to conceptualize, the cognitive faculty which the English says has dissolved; C05:51 also renders nominal 'du shes as ability to discriminate. This local nominal scope excludes their and creates no independent ability equivalent. Gzugs owns physical matter; kyi's relation is expressed through conceptualize taking a direct object, with no separate genitive word. Rnam par owns altogether and the tighter bshig stem owns dissolved, leaving has unwrapped. Only the first phyir owns causal for; ro is a wordless assertive closure. La, ste and the relative/nominal endings are omitted as distributed syntax. Final zhes gsungs pa'i phyir is the unexpressed outer citation frame. Those, who are, at the level we call the, the water, their and has remain unwrapped. C16:828 and C18:1120 contain later apparatus outside this row's shared English; P7:15 ends at has and cannot attest dissolved altogether. All original wording is preserved; no new erratum and no hgm_gloss promotion.</div>
